# textdomain: doggiowars
# Simplified Chinese translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=在漂浮的体素岛屿上空展开空战——你就是那架战斗机。12 种岛屿生物群系、火山与瀑布、特技飞行、可破坏地形，还有追逐金兔的灵缇赛跑。支持键盘和手柄。
